{"4589760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Confectionery Tale", "steam_appid": 4589760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589760/extras/25b1ba8926041cdd2c8f47201035dc2e.avif?t=1780923615\" width=413 height=443 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589760/extras/47de4481d68fbf270695089313bb3520.avif?t=1780923615\" width=168 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confectionery Tale is a persistent open world swarm shooter. Play as Kane and traverse Sweetopia while defeating a variety of different confections. Gain levels and collect drops to further increase your power. Interact with a variety of different mechanics to alter your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589760/extras/753bf1b9a6a22a161ce1989f14f99bb4.avif?t=1780923615\" width=706 height=181 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six weapon types with individual skill trees for further tweaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World skills for interacting with the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain Extracts to alter stats and apply unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize services to further customize gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect companions to join you and provide passive bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a large persistent world and gain bonuses for surviving longer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the endless Taffy Tower to see how far you can progress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\